      "writtenOn": "2025-06-17T16:11:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This check could be inside __pkvm_reprivilege_vcpu() (together with the loud comment below), and then no need to make pkvm_initialized externally visible?",
      "revId": "9ba54075d31d7de0c9ed21e82ace895b65984957",
